      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Sales were extremely helpful and informativeInstallers damaged the carport roof and said it was unavoidable. They would fix the roof but not reinstall panels, leaving us with a very small system. Gave a (very)small discount on price insteadInstallers also dodgied up the inverter install, cutting the warranty void if damaged tag to open up the box to install cable instead of using the plug provided.Inverter died, replaced under warranty as it was a known problem with that batch of inverters, but 10 months after the inverter died, only just got the new one installed as the customer support is laughable.Lost emails, computer viruses, not answering phone, a usually full mailbox but don't call back if you do get to leave a message, and trying to make us do the chasing around for a replacement plug instead of doing it themselves.I've had every excuse under the sun, and the problem was only solved because Samil (inverter manufacturer) has amazing customer service.And don't bother trying to complain, when asked for a manager or supervisor, receptionist invariably told us they were all on business trips in China.",
